#: a24b354af1fb4b2d9ba1eb82ca894e00
msgid "Contexts allow test suite state changes to be rolled back conveniently."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:39
#: e4131d6b4dda45aea595476e398a84d5
msgid "Each test gets an implicit context, and you can push any number of contexts onto the stack.  You do not need to wrap your test in a context - you get one for free from the harness."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/autotest-tests.rst:41
#: 7b847a76ba194e61ad8c40d26c2ea8a5
msgid "When you pop a context, various state change are reverted to the way they were before the context was pushed.  Notably:"
